// parts adapted from
// - https://blog.demofox.org/2020/05/25/casual-shadertoy-path-tracing-1-basic-camera-diffuse-emissive/
// - https://github.com/0beqz/realism-effects/blob/v2-debug/src/ssgi/shader/ssgi.frag

